OL,3,GNEWSARSPCA appeal after dog 'strangled
OL,4,Aand punched'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe RSPCA has launched an investigation
OL,7,Finto reports a dog was punched and
OL,8,Fstrangled in Leicester.
OL,10,FThe charity said a witness reported
OL,11,Fseeing a woman hit and punch the animal
OL,12,F"several times" at the play area in St
OL,13,FNicholas Circle at about 09:00 BST on
OL,14,FSunday.
OL,16,FThe dog was also allegedly pinned to
OL,17,Fthe ground and strangled, the RSPCA
OL,18,Fadded.
OL,20,FThe charity has released images of a
OL,21,Fwoman it would like to speak to as part
OL,22,Fof its investigation.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
